<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Casa Autrey.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Grupo Casa Autrey.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it started coverage of Grupo Casa Autrey as a buy.</p>
<p>-- It set a 12-month price target on the ADR at $24.50.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1/8 to 20-3/4 in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
